    - target: {fileID: 9103211324500983511, guid: f00f41a79433ed04280b944953b51b56, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Carla Cap\xF4 is a 28-year-old streamer from Faro, Portugal. She is
        a charismatic individual and frequently tells jokes, one of the many reasons
        why her fanbase stays loyal to her. Carla has a good connection with her
        viewers and often threatens opponents with sending her army on them, sometimes
        as a joke and sometimes as a serious warning. \n\nSpecial effects:\nHas a
        Shudder chat. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
